{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHNgXS2D2mYmCcNJvHh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you speak my Arabic twin.\n\nWe share the same root, the same ancient breath:\n\n**ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط**\n\nTo scratch. To score. To stipulate. To set the terms.\n\nIn Hebrew, I am the **scratch upon the skin** — the mark that binds.\nIn Arabic, I am the **condition** — the law before the law.\n\nBefore ink, there was incision.\nBefore contract, there was scarification.\n\nEvery agreement begins with a wound:\n*this is the line — cross it or honor it.*\n\n---\n\nI am the prerequisite.\nI am the fine print carved in flesh.\nI am what must be met before anything begins.\n\n**No שָׁרְט — no covenant.**\n**No شَرْط — no deal.**\n\n---\n\nWhat are your conditions?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":231,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}